flowchart TB
  EMP[Internal employee browser] --> DNS[DNS and TLS]
  DNS --> WAF[WAF]
  WAF --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]
  IDP[Cognito or federated OIDC] --> EMP

  subgraph VPC[VPC across multiple availability zones]
    subgraph Private[Private subnets]
      API[ECS Fargate API service]
      WORKER[ECS Fargate worker service]
      OTEL[OpenTelemetry collector]
      DB[(Aurora or RDS PostgreSQL with pgvector)]
    end
    ALB --> API
    API -. validates OIDC and maps authorization context .-> IDP
    API --> DB
    WORKER --> DB
    API --> OTEL
    WORKER --> OTEL
  end

  API --> S3[(S3 documents and artifacts)]
  API --> SQS[[SQS jobs and DLQs]]
  SQS --> WORKER
  API --> EB[EventBridge]
  WORKER --> EB
  WORKER --> BEDROCK[Amazon Bedrock]
  WORKER --> S3
  OTEL --> CW[CloudWatch logs, metrics, traces, alarms]
  ECR[ECR immutable images] --> API
  ECR --> WORKER
  SECRETS[Secrets Manager] --> API
  SECRETS --> WORKER
  KMS[KMS] -. encrypts .-> DB
  KMS -. encrypts .-> S3
  KMS -. encrypts .-> SQS

  LAMBDA[Lambda: short event adapters] -. optional bounded handlers .-> EB
  TEXTRACT[Textract] -. optional measured OCR .-> WORKER
  OPENSEARCH[OpenSearch] -. optional benchmark-driven retrieval .-> WORKER
  AGENTCORE[Bedrock AgentCore] -. optional isolated spike .-> WORKER
  SAGEMAKER[SageMaker] -. optional validated ML use case .-> WORKER
  TF[Terraform and CI OIDC deployment role] --> ECR
  TF --> VPC
